      "message": "Merge branch 'main' into issue/1198-drag-to-move\n\nHand-resolved, both sides kept:\n- crates/ui/src/egui_app/viewport_bar.rs: Move button next to main's\n  Projection/Orbit/Pan/Zoom buttons; NAV_COUNT 11, BAR_W for 11.\n- crates/ui/src/egui_app/shell.rs: main's nav-tool latch owns the press;\n  without a latch the PR's move-ball press guard runs as before.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
